<Layout title="Privacy & Demo Notice | NORTHLINE Advisory" description="Fictional investment advisory demo privacy information and illustrative calculator disclaimer." brand="NORTHLINE / ADVISORY" nav={[{label:'Home',href:p},{label:'Calculator',href:p+'#calculator'},{label:'Investor brief',href:p+'#qualification'}]} accent="#101d31"><section class="legal container"><p class="eyebrow">DEMONSTRATION / PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy & information notice.</h1><p>NORTHLINE is a fictional advisory identity. No licensed financial advice, actual investments or real broker relationships are represented.</p><h2>Investment calculations</h2><p>The calculator and recommendations are simplified educational examples only. They exclude applicable taxes, financing costs, capital expenditure, currency exposure, regulatory constraints and transaction fees. Returns are not guaranteed.</p><h2>Personal information</h2><p>Qualification answers and contact information remain in the browser unless you explicitly submit an enquiry after an actual secure endpoint is configured. There is no receiving service by default. A production operator would need a verified privacy policy, rights process and appropriate consent basis before collecting data.</p><h2>Marketing attribution</h2><p>UTM parameters and GCLID may be retained temporarily in session storage for an example attribution workflow; no third-party analytics are connected by default.</p><a href={p}>← Return to NORTHLINE</a></section></Layout>
